47
00:03:19,720 --> 00:03:23,520
You didn't need artifacts and spells to fight a Middle stage Soul Transformation.

48
00:03:24,200 --> 00:03:25,400
Can you tell me why ?

49
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:33,400
No comments.

50
00:03:34,640 --> 00:03:35,400
It's fine.

51
00:03:36,080 --> 00:03:37,400
The more secrets,

52
