60
00:03:56,080 --> 00:03:56,920
No need.

61
00:03:57,880 --> 00:03:58,680
Seventh Junior Brother !

62
00:03:59,600 --> 00:04:02,080
Don't you want to know why Senior Brother is targetting you ?

63
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:04,600
Or about what becoming a Son of Tian Yun

64
00:04:04,600 --> 00:04:05,920
actually means ?

65
00:04:09,080 --> 00:04:10,640
Every thousand years,

66
00:04:10,880 --> 00:04:14,120
