95
00:05:23,440 --> 00:05:24,400
Empty fame ?

96
00:05:26,080 --> 00:05:29,040
The Seven Sons of Tian Yun are extremely noble.

97
00:05:29,280 --> 00:05:30,280
They can

98
00:05:30,520 --> 00:05:31,960
choose any country on Planet Tian Yun,

99
00:05:31,960 --> 00:05:34,920
or even whole planets controlled by Tian Yun

100
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:36,680
