101
00:05:37,880 --> 00:05:39,000
Is that all ?

102
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:40,880
Besides that,

103
00:05:41,280 --> 00:05:44,080
Master will personally assist them during the Ascendant breakthrough,

104
00:05:44,080 --> 00:05:47,040
