105
00:05:47,320 --> 00:05:50,600
He even provides the Seven Sons of Tian Yun with unlimited celestial jades.

106
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:52,320
Aren't you tempted ?

107
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:57,200
If you don't want empty fame,

108
00:05:57,200 --> 00:05:58,400
