is the best gift of all.

275
00:15:01,200 --> 00:15:03,600
There are banquets in each of the 7 divisions.

276
00:15:04,680 --> 00:15:05,640
Everyone,

277
00:15:06,160 --> 00:15:07,560
please have a seat.

278
00:15:59,280 --> 00:16:02,400
Wang Lin's avatar\NMiddle stage Soul Transformation

279
00:16:04,040 --> 00:16:05,240
Situ Nan told me

280
00:16:05,800 --> 00:16:07,280
that with a higher cultivation,

281
00:16:07,320 --> 00:16:09,280
the three killing spells will get stronger.

282
00:16:09,560 --> 00:16:11,040
Let me see

283
00:16:11,600 --> 00:16:13,600
how much this formation can withstand.

284
00:16:14,520 --> 00:16:15,240
Death Finger !

285
00:16:35,520 --> 00:16:36,480
Demonic Finger !

286
00:16:41,000 --> 00:16:42,770
So it's not that strong...

287
00:16:53,280 --> 00:16:54,120
Cao Yidou,

288
00:16:54,560 --> 00:16:55,880
do you know the way

289
00:16:56,360 --> 00:16:57,800
to the Heavenly Fate Sect ?

290
00:16:58,080 --> 00:16:58,720
Yes.

291
00:17:07,480 --> 00:17:09,400
We're celebrating Master's birthday today.

292
00:17:09,720 --> 00:17:11,760
And tomorrow, Master will give a lecture on the Dao.

293
00:17:12,600 --> 00:17:13,880
If our Purple Division

294
00:17:14,080 --> 00:17:16,400
has been lacking in hospitality these past few days

295
00:17:16,480 --> 00:17:17,880
I hope you will be excuse us.

296
00:17:22,080 --> 00:17:23,920
I've heard that after the lecture,

297
00:17:23,960 --> 00:17:26,960
there will be a competition for the Seven Sons of Tian Yun.

298
00:17:27,480 --> 00:17:28,200
I think that

299
00:17:28,840 --> 00:17:30,720
Brother Zhao has a high chance of winning.

300
00:17:32,120 --> 00:17:33,120
You flatter me.

301
00:17:36,480 --> 00:17:37,280
What's that ?

302
00:17:37,480 --> 00:17:38,480
Is someone coming ?

303
00:17:38,760 --> 00:17:39,920
Such a large commotion...

304
00:17:40,040 --> 00:17:41,200
Are they hostile ?

305
00:17:41,200 --> 00:17:43,120
Who dares to intrude in our Heavenly Fate Sect ?

306
00:17:48,200 --> 00:17:49,120
How is this possible ?

307
00:17:49,640 --> 00:17:50,880
It's just been 3 months.

308
00:17:51,120 --> 00:17:52,280
Not only did he break free

309
00:17:53,000 --> 00:17:55,120
but he also reached Middle stage Soul Transformation ?

310
00:17:56,600 --> 00:17:57,880
Seventh Brother,

311
00:17:57,920 --> 00:17:59,520
it's quite disrespectful of you to be late

312
00:18:00,200 --> 00:18:01,720
at an important event

313
00:18:02,560 --> 00:18:03,640
like this banquet.

314
00:18:04,080 --> 00:18:06,060
He's the Seventh disciple of the Purple Division ?

315
00:18:05,400 --> 00:18:07,000
Why is he late for Master's banquet ?

316
00:18:07,000 --> 00:18:08,160
So disrespectful...

317
00:18:10,880 --> 00:18:11,800
Senior Brother,

318
00:18:12,280 --> 00:18:13,680
all you've done is messing with me

319
00:18:13,960 --> 00:18:15,680
since I joined the Heavenly Fate Sect.

320
00:18:16,120 --> 00:18:18,200
You've even gone to the extent

321
00:18:18,800 --> 00:18:21,760
of seeking outside help to prevent me from coming today

322
00:18:21,920 --> 00:18:23,800
by teleporting me away from the sect

323
00:18:24,400 --> 00:18:26,200
and trapping me in the Stone Forest.

324
00:18:26,320 --> 00:18:27,800
I, Wang Lin, have a principle.

325
00:18:28,040 --> 00:18:29,720
If one doesn't mess with me,

326
00:18:29,840 --> 00:18:31,320
I won't mess with them.

327
00:18:32,280 --> 00:18:34,400
But if someone dares to mess with me

328
00:18:34,640 --> 00:18:36,800
I will destroy them !

329
00:18:44,440 --> 00:20:48,960
It wasn't properly explained how the All-Seer's disciples work.\NThe All-Seer has 7 true direct disciples known as the Seven Sons of Tian Yun (they actually weren't ever called like that in the novel but just called "true disciples").\NBut there is a total of 49 disciples of the All-Seer that lead each of the 7 divisions (that's what Wang Lin is right now). Below those are regular Heavenly Fate Sect disciples.\NIt's said that the Seven Sons of Tian Yun get infinite celestial jades and then it isn't really explained why Wang Lin fetches celestial jades. That's because there is a regular distribution of celestial jades to the All-Seer's disciples. Each one gets 100 celestial jades per month. But the jades are assigned by slot and the slot of the Seventh Purple Division disciple has been empty since Sun Yun left 103 years ago.\NThat astronomical number of celestial jades blows Wang Lin's mind. In the donghua he just like "Yeah cool I can cultivate now".\N\N\NWang Lin was startled. Even with his mental strength, he couldn’t help but be shocked. He took a deep breath and said, “I want to withdraw them all !”\N\N“A total of 123,600 pieces !” As the giant’s voice echoed, countless celestial jades flew out of the giant’s body and piled up before Wang Lin.\N\NWang Lin stared at the the pile of celestial jades as it rapidly grew and felt his throat dry up. He never would have thought that the Heavenly Fate Sect distributed celestial jades like this.\N“If a disciple spot remains empty for tens of thousands of years, then won’t the amount of celestial jades collect to an unimaginable degree ? Celestial jades are supposed to be rare, so why does the Heavenly Sect have so many…” Wang Lin took a deep breath. At this moment, the celestial jades had already formed a small mountain. His eyes lit up as he quickly put them into his bag of holding.\N\NAfter doing all of this, he touched his bag of holding. He still felt like none of this was real.

330
00:18:49,990 --> 00:18:55,630
I've been walking this path for endless years

331
00:18:52,290 --> 00:18:55,630
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

332
00:18:56,270 --> 00:19:01,230
Is it the compass of fate

333
00:18:58,110 --> 00:19:01,230
that wrote this outcome for us ?

334
00:19:01,390 --> 00:19:07,150
The heavens want to erase your existence,

335
00:19:07,270 --> 00:19:12,870
that's the obsession guiding me.

336
00:19:13,150 --> 00:19:18,470
Is this the path to uncover

337
00:19:15,030 --> 00:19:18,470
truths from falsehoods ?

338
00:19:18,750 --> 00:19:24,070
In a world of murk and shadow,

339
00:19:20,650 --> 00:19:24,070
only the flame of truth can light the way.

340
00:19:24,110 --> 00:19:29,790
Look at them all,

341
00:19:26,990 --> 00:19:29,790
being carried by the waves.

342
00:19:30,230 --> 00:19:34,430
Look at them all,

343
00:19:32,390 --> 00:19:34,430
being drowned.

344
00:19:34,510 --> 00:19:37,750
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

345
00:19:37,790 --> 00:19:40,830
I will let the world refine my soul.

346
00:19:40,960 --> 00:19:46,390
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

347
00:19:42,650 --> 00:19:46,390
I will fight.

348
00:19:46,390 --> 00:19:49,510
I'll break through the abyss of despair

349
00:19:49,510 --> 00:19:52,550
to finally learn who I really am.

350
00:19:52,550 --> 00:19:57,910
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

351
00:19:54,430 --> 00:19:57,910
I embrace this obsession.

352
00:19:57,910 --> 00:20:00,870
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

353
00:20:00,870 --> 00:20:03,670
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

354
00:20:03,670 --> 00:20:09,150
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

355
00:20:05,710 --> 00:20:09,150
I'll still fight.

356
00:20:09,350 --> 00:20:12,510
It's hard to avoid loneliness

357
00:20:12,510 --> 00:20:15,550
when you are above everyone else.

358
00:20:15,550 --> 00:20:21,230
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

359
00:20:17,870 --> 00:20:21,230
be afraid of a firefly ?
